6.pdf","source_title":"The Key: The Hampden-Sydney College Student Handbook, 2025–2026","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-01-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Follow the host event's participation expectations.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"glass-of-the-finest-song","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Glass of the Finest","title":"Recognize “Glass of the Finest”","subtitle":"Official College song","notes":"Treat this as a documented College song rather than a drinking prompt. Learn its refrain from the handbook and follow alcohol rules at every event.","short_summary":"A second named College song is printed alongside the alma-mater hymn.","evidence_claim":"The 2025–2026 student handbook lists “Glass of the Finest” in its College songs section.","source_url":"https://www.hsc.edu/Documents/StudentLife/TheKey2025%E2%80%9326.pdf","source_title":"The Key: The Hampden-Sydney College Student Handbook, 2025–2026","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-01-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The card concerns the song only; do not use it to encourage alcohol consumption.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rhetoric-proficiency-examination","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Rhetoric Proficiency Examination","title":"Take the Rhetoric Proficiency Examination","subtitle":"Required College-wide writing milestone","notes":"Plan ahead for the timed writing exam after completing the relevant coursework. It is a recurring College requirement, not a public drop-in activity.","short_summary":"Since 1978, every Hampden-Sydney student has had to meet this rhetoric milestone.","evidence_claim":"The College states that all students, regardless of major, must pass the Rhetoric Proficiency Examination.","source_url":"https: