//250.hsc.edu/civic-virtue/","source_title":"Civic Virtue – Hampden-Sydney 250th Anniversary","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For enrolled students; consult the academic calendar and Rhetoric Program for eligibility and scheduling.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"the-game-randolph-macon","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"The Game","title":"Mark “The Game” Against Randolph-Macon","subtitle":"Annual Hampden-Sydney–Randolph-Macon football rivalry","notes":"Follow the Tigers' announced schedule for the Randolph-Macon matchup. Attend only with a valid event ticket or watch through the College's listed broadcast options.","short_summary":"The annual archrival football contest is formally known as “The Game.”","evidence_claim":"Hampden-Sydney Athletics identifies the 2026 contest with Randolph-Macon as the 131st edition of “The Game.”","source_url":"https://hscathletics.com/news/2026/4/16/hampden-sydney-announces-2026-football-schedule.aspx","source_title":"Hampden-Sydney Announces 2026 Football Schedule","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-04-16","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Scheduled for November 14, 2026, at Fulton Field at Lewis C. Everett Stadium; ticketing details should be checked closer to the event.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"commencement-bell-tower-lineup","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Bell Tower Commencement Lineup","title":"Line Up at the Bell Tower","subtitle":"Senior commencement ritual","notes":"For graduating seniors, arrive in regalia at the Bell Tower at the announced lineup time. Families can watch the later commencement ceremony from designated areas.","short_summary":"The Bell Tower anchors the senior lineup immediately before the College's commencement ceremony.","evidence_claim":"The College's 2026 commencement schedule directs seniors to line up in full regalia at the Bell Tower before commencement.","source_url":"https://www.hsc.edu/parents-and-family/commencement/commencement-schedule","source_title":"Commencement Schedule","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For graduating seniors and their guests during commencement; follow the current year's posted instructions.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
